  <h2>5. Key Features Implemented</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Department Filtering:</strong> Instant tabbed filtering across CSE, ECE, Mechanical, Civil, Exam Cell, Placement Cell, and All Departments.</li>
    <li><strong>Live Keyword Search:</strong> Real-time search through titles, descriptions, and circular contents.</li>
    <li><strong>Role-Based Access Control:</strong> Interactive modal allowing instant switching between Admin and Student mode with auto-fill demo credentials.</li>
    <li><strong>Notice Management:</strong> Admin portal for publishing and deleting circulars.</li>
    <li><strong>Responsive UI:</strong> Mobile-friendly, tablet-optimized layout built with React and custom CSS.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Tech Stack Used</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> React.js (Hooks: useState, useEffect)</li>
    <li><strong>Styling:</strong> Pure CSS3 (Flexbox & CSS Grid)</li>
    <li><strong>Build Tool:</strong> Vite</li>
    <li><strong>Cloud Hosting:</strong> Render (Static Site)</li>
    <li><strong>Version Control:</strong> Git & GitHub</li>
  </ul>

